00:42:01.119 --> 00:42:02.119
with it.

00:42:02.119 --> 00:42:03.119
It's confusing.

00:42:03.119 --> 00:42:04.119
It's upsetting, you know.

00:42:04.119 --> 00:42:07.970
So, so to me that emotional dysregulation
that comes out of a bad childhood is a really

00:42:07.970 --> 00:42:12.620
critical piece usually to understanding kids
who grow up and are willing to do violence.

00:42:12.620 --> 00:42:14.180
Yeah, for sure.

00:42:14.180 --> 00:42:15.220
For sure.

00:42:15.220 --> 00:42:20.570
Um, so, so right now we're kind of talking
