00:42:20.570 --> 00:42:23.420
even though Jay said he was an optimist, but...

00:42:23.420 --> 00:42:26.750
Not by the end of this panel...

00:42:26.750 --> 00:42:29.140
Well let's try to harness some of that optimism.

00:42:29.140 --> 00:42:31.340
Jon, you, you seem the most pessimistic.

00:42:31.340 --> 00:42:41.140
Can you, so can you kind of elaborate a little
