00:43:10.420 --> 00:43:15.800
good how, how, how quickly things are getting
better and war is dropping, violence is dropping.

00:43:15.800 --> 00:43:17.740
So there's a lot of reasons for optimism.

00:43:17.740 --> 00:43:21.720
Many of the big indicators about the United
States, obviously violence is, is way down

00:43:21.720 --> 00:43:24.370
a lot of other things are good.

00:43:24.370 --> 00:43:27.990
Furthermore, if I, if you asked me a hundred
