00:43:41.510 --> 00:43:46.250
and the same US constitution revised only
through an amendment process, three years

00:43:46.250 --> 00:43:48.320
ago I would've said 99 point something percent.

00:43:48.320 --> 00:43:51.520
I mean 50 years from now it's gonna be the
same country and now I would say maybe 80

00:43:51.520 --> 00:43:52.520
percent, 70 percent.

00:43:52.520 --> 00:43:55.940
Like I would bet that we'll still be here,
but it's quite conceivable that we won't because

00:43:55.940 --> 00:43:57.240
things can go bad very quickly.

00:43:57.240 --> 00:44:02.350
And what I mean by that is, you know, it is,
if you accept the picture I gave of human

00:44:02.350 --> 00:44:08.780
nature that we evolved to be small group tribalists
and that's the way we evolved, we're able

00:44:08.780 --> 00:44:09.780
to live in different ways.

00:44:09.780 --> 00:44:13.080
We're able to live in a large, multiethnic,
secular democracy.

00:44:13.080 --> 00:44:18.540
We know that because we did it, but it may
be that the margin of error for that might

00:44:18.540 --> 00:44:26.430
be very small and there was a, nobody is old
enough now to remember before the 1940's,

00:44:26.430 --> 00:44:32.690
late thirties, um, but the postwar world in
America had a huge surplus of centripetal

00:44:32.690 --> 00:44:33.690
forces.

00:44:33.690 --> 00:44:34.690
Things binding us together.

00:44:34.690 --> 00:44:35.690
It was historically unprecedented.

00:44:35.690 --> 00:44:40.140
I mean, even the media that we've never had
a media environment that really pulled us

00:44:40.140 --> 00:44:43.560
all onto the same page except for the postwar
several decades.

00:44:43.560 --> 00:44:47.580
Um, uh, we, we reduced immigration in the
twenties.

00:44:47.580 --> 00:44:49.900
Immigration does many good things for the
economy, but it makes it harder to have a

00:44:49.900 --> 00:44:51.940
shared set of norms.

00:44:51.940 --> 00:44:57.730
So everything was lined up from maximum centripetal
force for about 40 years after the war.

00:44:57.730 --> 00:45:00.619
And then gradually those things started drifting
away

00:45:00.619 --> 00:45:06.430
And so when I look at the, when I look at
