00:45:19.480 --> 00:45:23.510
every previous democracy had, that, the founding
fathers fears, if you read the federalist

00:45:23.510 --> 00:45:27.930
papers in federalist 10, um, that those fears,
I think were quite warranted and it's possible

00:45:27.930 --> 00:45:32.650
that we're now operating outside of the parameter
zone in which this is a stable democracy.

00:45:32.650 --> 00:45:37.030
I'm not saying that we are, I'm just saying
