00:45:37.030 --> 00:45:42.530
Small countries, if you have a small country
where people have a sense of shared fate and

00:45:42.530 --> 00:45:46.920
there, but for the grace of God, go I, and
if you need help, I'll help you because if

00:45:46.920 --> 00:45:48.520
I need help, you'll help me.

00:45:48.520 --> 00:45:52.270
Well, that's why Scandinavian countries are
