00:45:59.110 --> 00:46:01.570
And I agree with him, the answer is yes.

00:46:01.570 --> 00:46:09.340
So if you have a very large, very diverse,
um, um, uh, country, um, what holds it together?

00:46:09.340 --> 00:46:11.980
What leads people to accept the process?

00:46:11.980 --> 00:46:14.860
What leads people to accept that, Oh, the
