00:47:39.820 --> 00:47:44.700
because you watch the person kind of break
it down and say, you know, I don't want to

00:47:44.700 --> 00:47:45.700
be this way.

00:47:45.700 --> 00:47:47.010
Why did this, why did this happen to me?

00:47:47.010 --> 00:47:48.070
So that's the good stuff.

00:47:48.070 --> 00:47:54.950
But, but my problem is that I do believe that
