Jay, save us.

00:49:06.440 --> 00:49:08.660
Come on, bring it home.

00:49:08.660 --> 00:49:10.940
I'm dispositionally optimistic.

00:49:10.940 --> 00:49:11.940
I'm also Canadian.

00:49:11.940 --> 00:49:12.940
You're Canadian!

00:49:12.940 --> 00:49:14.300
You're Canadian, Jay is Canadian, everyone.

