00:51:19.450 --> 00:51:23.060
And I know like the people at Facebook are
hard at work, like right now, trying to fix

00:51:23.060 --> 00:51:27.040
their algorithms to promote better interactions.

00:51:27.040 --> 00:51:31.240
And 2.3, 2.34 billion people are on social
