like social media are almost bringing us back
to some of our more primal moments in a way,

00:52:31.540 --> 00:52:35.859
even though, you know, they bring us together
and yet they've also torn us apart by, by

00:52:35.859 --> 00:52:37.550
kind of doing this.

00:52:37.550 --> 00:52:44.330
So, um, so I guess then the question is, and
you've done some work on kind of increasing

00:52:44.330 --> 00:52:49.390
empathy among people, you know, how do we
given this new landscape, you know, I don't,

00:52:49.390 --> 00:52:53.990
I honestly, I'm not optimistic about getting,
